Third-party dependency licences
-------------------------------
This project depends on numerous third-party open-source libraries. The
authoritative, per-image inventory of what actually ships — every package,
version, and resolved licence in the production closure of each image — is the
CycloneDX SBOM set under docs/audits/sbom/:

  - docs/audits/sbom/platos-agent.cdx.json   (agent image production closure)
  - docs/audits/sbom/platos-webapp.cdx.json  (webapp image production closure)

Regenerate with `pnpm audit:sbom` and verify with `pnpm audit:sbom:check` plus
`pnpm audit:sbom:nonvacuity`. The closure contract and receipts above record the
actual checked image set and fail-loud evidence boundary.

Recorded licence elections (dual-licensed dependencies)
-------------------------------------------------------
Where a shipped dependency offers a choice of licences, Platos elects as follows
(machine-readable in docs/audits/sbom/license-overlay.json):

  - dompurify (both images): published "(MPL-2.0 OR Apache-2.0)" — Platos elects
    Apache-2.0.
  - json-schema: published "(AFL-2.1 OR BSD-3-Clause)" — Platos elects BSD-3-Clause.

